// Frontier Command's voice - the dialogue scenes for the cast lifeform
// `frontier_command` (Speaker = his key). Spliced into the `## Dialogue` section.

# [Frontier Command](frontier_hail)
---
Speaker: frontier_command
When: comms
---
% Frontier Command here, captain. You're a long way from home.
% Report when able. We read what the sides make of you out there.

- [Report in](frontier_done)
- [Request guidance](frontier_advice)

# [Guidance](frontier_advice)
---
Speaker: frontier_command
---
% Keep your standing clean with the neutral sides; the foe systems will test you.
% Watch the Ashfang lanes - their captains hold grudges.

- [Understood](frontier_done)

# [Out](frontier_done)
---
Speaker: frontier_command
---
% Frontier Command out. Stay sharp, captain.

// Passenger Doctor Sela Voss's voice (Speaker = her lifeform key), hailable while
// she's aboard.
# [Doctor Sela Voss](sela_hail)
---
Speaker: sela_voss
When: comms
---
% Thank you for the passage, captain. The Verdant worlds are a long way out.
% Mind the Ashfang lanes - I'd rather arrive in one piece.

- [Reassure her](sela_done)
- [Say nothing](sela_done)

# [Settled In](sela_done)
---
Speaker: sela_voss
---
% I'll be in the observation lounge if you need me.

// The saboteur courier's voice. Hail him once the crew report sabotage, then Detain
// (the choice emits `detain_saboteur`, which stops the sabotage and puts him off).
# [A Nervous Courier](courier_hail)
---
Speaker: courier
When: comms
---
% I paid for passage, not an interrogation. Eyes forward, captain.
% ...is something wrong? You're looking at me strangely.

- [Let it go](courier_done)
- [Detain him](courier_caught) ; signal detain_saboteur

# [Caught](courier_caught)
---
Speaker: courier
---
% You don't know what you've just stopped, captain. They'll send another.

# [Move Along](courier_done)
---
Speaker: courier
---
% Smart. Mind your own business and we'll get along fine.
